;; bin/repr-java front-check (bin/lib/repr-java/front-check): the forms files, by corpus, that may differ
;; between the conversion of javac's trees and that of the native trees (doc/classes/JAVA-FRONTEND-SURVEY.md,
;; "As built: JFS66 (b)", JFS70). Each is a call whose param-tags pin the converter's resolution
;; (arbace.repr.java.resolve over arbace.classes' class infos made from javac's symbols) decides by the
;; history of the javac run: converting javac's own trees twice in one run, or in two runs, gives the
;; same differences, so they are not the native trees'. Paths relative to the corpus's directory
;; (MODULE/javac/...).
{:samples #{}
 :baseline #{}
 :jdk #{}
 :javac #{}
 :jdk26u #{"jdk.javadoc/jdk/javadoc/internal/tool/ElementsTable.ae"
           "jdk.javadoc/jdk/javadoc/internal/doclint/Checker.ae"
           "jdk.jdeps/com/sun/tools/jdeprscan/Main.ae"}}
